        "at": [
          7,
          15
        ],
        "text": "A little brass bell. The register is open at TODAY. Beneath it: rooms and permits to the left; work orders to the right. Someone has added, in pencil: lost umbrellas wherever they turn up."
      },
      {
        "id": "job-desk",
        "title": "Public Works · job desk",
        "at": [
          20,
          15
        ],
        "text": "Nell’s workshop is on the approved contractors list. The public works book keeps your current tickets here too. Pinned under it, in a quick hand: SQUARE JOBS — ASK MIRA. SHE’LL BE AT THE SERVICE SCREEN."
      },
      {
